cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Open BESS Edge in your research or industrial deployment,
  please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
title: "Open BESS Edge"
abstract: >-
  Production-grade edge gateway and real-time controller for Battery Energy
  Storage Systems (BESS). Communicates via Modbus TCP with PCS/inverters and BMS,
  enforces an in-memory fail-closed physical safety envelope, executes droop
  frequency response (FFR/PFR) and reactive power voltage support (Volt/VAR),
  and logs verifiable audit telemetry via a tamper-evident append-only hash chain.
